    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know, but it's not just being tired. it's like i'm watching the same tragedies on repeat and nothing i do actually changes the outcome. it's just a cycle. i look at these people and i don't even see life anymore, just more pain that's inevitable. it feels so pointless.",
